n class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md\">../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S(e,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\leftrightarrow e(p)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}e(q))\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl((\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q))\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}e(p)\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}e(q))\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(e[A],\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}complete\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompleteEmbedding}_S(e,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb Q)\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q\\leftrightarrow e(p)\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}e(q))\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl((\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;(r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p\\land r\\leq_{\\mathbb P}q))\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}e(p)\\land s\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}e(q))\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\to\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(e[A],\\mathbb Q,\\leq_{\\mathbb Q}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resol